{"additions":2,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## v0.11.0\n\n- #154 — Files view: Markdown files rendered in the preview (`markdown-preview \"render\" | \"raw\"`, `m` toggles; shared `core::ui::markdown` renderer)\n- #156 — `y` copies the URL of anything `o` can open (GitHub issue / PR / run lists and details, Projects board and list; `Y` on the git log for the commit URL, all built locally without API requests)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w","changedFiles":2,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-03T06:26:10Z","deletions":2,"headRefName":"release/0.11.0","labels":[],"number":158,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABL-VoAg","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe changes are a straightforward, internally consistent version bump in both manifest and lockfile with no additional behavioral impact.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nBumps the crate version to v0.11.0 in preparation for the v0.11.0 release of `vig` (a read-only TUI cockpit for repository-centric workflows).\n\n**Changes:**\n- Update the package version in `Cargo.toml` to `0.11.0`.\n- Sync the `vig` entry version in `Cargo.lock` to `0.11.0`.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| Cargo.toml | Updates the crate’s declared version to `0.11.0`. |\r\n| Cargo.lock | Updates the lockfile’s `vig` package entry to `0.11.0` to match the release version. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 1/2 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 0\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\